<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n97356" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">στῠγερ-ός</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ά</span>,
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">όν</span>, poet. Adj.
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>hated, abominated,
			loathed</i>, or <i>hateful, abominable, loathsome</i>, freq. in 
				Ep.
			 and Trag., both of persons and things; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ς. Ἀΐδης</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					8.368
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ἐρινῦς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Od.
					2.135
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δαίμων, πόλεμος, γάμος,
			πένθος</span>, etc., <i><span class="en">
				5.396
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Il.
				4.240
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Od.
				1.249
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Il.
				22.483
			</span></i>, etc.; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μοῖρα, μοῦσα</span>, <i><span class="en">
				A.
				<u>Pers.</u>
				909
			</span></i> (anap.), <i><span class="en">
				<u>Eu.</u>
				308
			</span></i> (anap.); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γᾶ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					S.
					<u>Ph.</u>
					1175
				</span></i>
			 (lyr.); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μάτηρ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>Med.</u>
					113
				</span></i>
			 (anap.); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τυραννίη</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Xenoph.
					3.2
				</span></i>
			: c. dat., <i>hateful</i> to one, <i><span class="en">
				Il.
				14.158
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λάθα Πιερίσι ς</span>. <i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				568
			</span></i> (lyr.). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>hateful, wretched</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βίος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Tr.</u>
					1017
				</span></i>
			 (s. v.l., lyr.); <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ς. πάθεα, ς.
			ἐγώ</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Ach.</u>
				1191
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				1208
			</span></i> (paratrag.); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πλοῦτος . . θνᾴσκοντι -ώτατος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pi.
					<u>O.</u>
					10(11).90
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			Adv.
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-ρῶς</span>
			<i>to one's sorrow, miserably</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Il.
				16.723
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Od.
				23.23
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>Ph.</u>
				166
			</span></i> (lyr., nisi leg. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σμυγερῶς</span>).</div>
